<title>THAILAND: Berli Jucker third qrtr net 178 mln baht.</title>
<headline>Berli Jucker third qrtr net 178 mln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial results for the nine months ending Septemer 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>			     Third quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 3.09     vs	     3.27</p>
<p>    Net			178.39     vs	   188.70</p>
<p>				Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 8.03     vs	     7.23</p>
<p>    Net			463.55     vs	   417.39</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 figures include one-time gain of 57.5 million baht on sale and restructuring of investments. Excluding special item, the company said net grew 36 percent in quarter and 29 percent in the nine months. Total revenues rose five percent in the quarter and 10 percent in the first nine months. Berli Jucker is a diversified consumer products group.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
